WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
An already-connected Linux preview pair. Pauses are cut.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.600
Inspect the existing Sync connection.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:12.900
Edit the note and add your next idea.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:14.500
Switch to Source view.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.700
Before arrival: the second computer has not updated yet.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:16.200
Wait shortened.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.400
The new line arrives on the second computer.
